3.  **Save and Exit:** Press **`Ctrl+O`**, then **`Enter`**, then **`Ctrl+X`**.

### One final step to clean GitHub:
After you save the file, you still need to tell GitHub to "forget" the versions it already has. Run these commands one last time:
```bash
git rm --cached binomial_coefficient sum_N sum_digit upper_lowercase
git add .gitignore
git commit -m "Final cleanup of extensionless binaries"
git push origin main
